			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Consolidate formatting across ESBuild configs and TypeScript source\n\n Standardize code formatting across the Cocoon extension host build system and TypeScript source files. Apply consistent blank lines after import blocks, object property spacing, and closing bracket placement to match the project's PascalCase style guide.\n\nUpdates ESBuild configuration files (Bootstrap.js, Cocoon.js, Base/Config.js, Bootstrap/Config.js, Compile/Config.js, Environment/Constant.js, Target.js, index.js, Mountain/Config.js) and source files (Main.ts, Schema.ts, various Handler, Service, and Effect modules). Commas removed from trailing list items; line breaks added for improved readability in object literals and Effect.gen blocks. No functional changes introduced.",
